Package: motanka-stack-shell
Architecture: amd64
Depends: motanka-qt6,
         tesseract-ocr,
         tesseract-ocr-eng,
         wl-clipboard,
         xdg-utils,
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
Description: Hyprland stack for Motanka - desktop shell and screenshot tool
 Motanka is an Omarchy-compatible Hyprland layer for Ubuntu. Its Stack is
 the Hyprland compositor with its companion programs and libraries at the
 versions upstream Omarchy expects, installed under /opt/motanka.
 .
 This package holds Quickshell, the QML desktop shell upstream Omarchy uses
 for its bar and menus, and the cpptrace library its crash handler needs;
 omasnap, the screenshot and annotation tool upstream Omarchy runs for the
 Print key, with layer-shell-qt, the Qt library it draws its capture overlay
 with. They run on the Qt 6.12 in motanka-qt6 on both Ubuntu 24.04 and 26.04
 and never load Ubuntu's own Qt. omasnap's menu entry is visible only in
 the Motanka session.
